500kfkwtJouRcFZTm4Q.jpg\"}],\"similar\":[{\"id\":289959,\"title\":\"Filipinas\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/2evARX69eH4zYQejBgZugJLWSFS.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/nEZWh9iXOeOiIY1NtlFlpIr44V4.jpg\",\"rating\":9,\"year\":2003,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Florencia, the matriarch of the Filipinas family, is in poor health, and Yolanda, the eldest of the Filipinas children, finds herself in the unenviable position of keeping her bickering family from disintegration. As the tension rises, Yolanda seeks refuge in a local church. She is critically injured trying to break up a nasty fight between brothers Emman and Samuel, forcing her family to make a life-changing decision.\",\"genres\":[\"Drama\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":860545,\"title\":\"He Does Not Want Peace\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/jQc7a5Fgj7fPHmy04LQCdmZRvdN.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/9hxLLhgo77dGAIoX4r3PgBlHKoq.jpg\",\"rating\":8,\"year\":2016,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"When a man witnesses a profound event, it threatens to destroy his family.\",\"genres\":[\"Drama\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":23160,\"title\":\"Werckmeister Harmonies\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/ix3pquGqTkCW86UbVTdRcrhGEFm.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/pyCUjcPHZrMY125lWpWAxEexe7C.jpg\",\"rating\":7.9,\"year\":2001,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A naive young man witnesses an escalation of violence in his small hometown following the arrival of a mysterious circus attraction.\",\"genres\":[\"Drama\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":25050,\"title\":\"Still Walking\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/FWJbhAPdwiwKhUaAyz841jpYa1.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/lvSB0bnLzuxwrfTlI2l13gctWRn.jpg\",\"rating\":7.8,\"year\":2008,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A family gathers together for a commemorative ritual whose nature only gradually becomes clear.\",\"genres\":[\"Drama\",\"Family\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":666088,\"title\":\"Mamá, mamá, mamá\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/693GzhR4UhKydo4UOIvBJj23Cn9.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/eQB9fO73RscQnrcOOEyhtlRlbGO.jpg\",\"rating\":6.7,\"year\":2021,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A veil of sadness lies over the oppressively hot summer days. Cleo dives into daydreams with her cousins, the girls share secret signs and rituals. Flowing gently, in impressionistic images, the empty space that the death of Cleo’s sister has left in the family is poetically encircled.\",\"genres\":[\"Drama\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":23596,\"title\":\"The Blessing\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/swl6H077DiBA3j1tBtezxssy57A.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/39OAJUcF1IjtgTtjWYN2smiuOU3.jpg\",\"rating\":6.1,\"year\":2009,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Overwhelmed and extra-sensitive, Katrine has a hard time coping when her more relaxed boyfriend, Andreas, takes a business trip just days after the birth of their first child. The fussy baby has difficulty breastfeeding, and vulnerable, insecure Katrine feels like a failure. When Katrine’s emotionally withholding mother Lise consents to stay for a few days, the two quickly fall into what are clearly familiar dysfunctional behavior patterns.\",\"genres\":[\"Drama\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":681530,\"title\":\"Are You Listening Mother?\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/6XhE56s45uzBYdpZaIiOw4z2uvQ.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/ygs6dnaesmxNS7Au7ZviuL55Xpe.jpg\",\"rating\":6,\"year\":2019,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A Kurdish woman is sentenced to six years of house arrest with an electronic ankle bracelet. The charge: supporting terrorist activities. From now on an invisible border runs through her garden in a Turkish village, which she repeatedly trespasses. Her older son is torn between obedience and rebellion. How far will he go to protect his mother from further punishment?\",\"genres\":[\"Drama\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":287636,\"title\":\"The Sound and the Fury\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/b6U8GH0NLR3y9YDUzoiAP72xqAd.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/phJM1oPu1f185vxgqhv0wt2JE7i.jpg\",\"rating\":5,\"year\":2015,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A look at the trials and tribulations of The Compson siblings, living in the deep south during the early part of the 20th century.\",\"genres\":[\"Drama\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1255487,\"title\":\"There Had Better Be Blood\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/66qm0qVcuqHhtyjUzYvp6ocuobE.jpg\",\"backdrop\":null,\"rating\":5,\"year\":2010,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"After another of their fights, rival brothers are forced to wait at a country train station en route to their Father's. Their mother tells them the next time she has to intervene in their in-fighting, there had better be blood.\",\"genres\":[\"Comedy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":26264,\"title\":\"George of the Jungle 2\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/hMJbCWC9EpkVNKM3KaIOElCQIrT.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/8FwLEl7WNO2vTn6ZVukKFgpwJlz.jpg\",\"rating\":4.5,\"year\":2003,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"George and Ursula now have a son, George Junior, so Ursula's mother arrives to try and take them back to \\\"civilization\\\".\",\"genres\":[\"Adventure\",\"Comedy\",\"Family\"],\"daysUntil\":null}],\"videos\":[{\"key\":\"kdYEhH0yJbY\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"},{\"key\":\"oNkoj9T0fVk\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"},{\"key\":\"0i8QfQdDR5c\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"}],\"daysUntil\":null}","status":200,"url":""},"revalidate":86400,"tags":[]}